WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:20.730
[Girl shown with big smile.]

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.690
[Girl is sitting at table with plates of food and a glass of milk.]

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:39.960
[Girl cuts up food and eats.]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.740
[Diagram of a tooth with a pointer showing where the enamel is located.]

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:05.620
[Diagram of a tooth with a pointer showing where the Cementum is located.]

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:22.660
[Diagram of a tooth with a pointer showing where the Dentine is located.]

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:38.520
[Diagram of a tooth with a pointer showing where the Dental Pulp is located.]

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:56.740
[Girl is shown sitting at table eating and drinking.]

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.680
[Girl is sitting at a table with a plate of fruit. ]

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:11.460
[She chooses an apple and bites into it. Close-up of the girl chewing.]

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:20.060
[Close-up of a mouth with lips pulled back. Teeth are stained and unclean.]

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:29.030
[The mouth opens and closes.]

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:42.430
[A hygienist is shown welcoming a young boy to a dental chair.]

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:48.600
[The boy sits down and the hygienist puts a dental bib on him.]

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.230
[The hygienist pulls a tray of dental tools towards her.]

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:57.340
[The hygienist looks at the boy's teeth with a dental mirror.]

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:05.090
[The hygienist scrapes the boy's upper front teeth.]

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:08.740
[The hygienist paints the teeth with a dark solution.]

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:15.580
[Close-up of the boy's mouth as solution is being applied.]

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.520
[The hygienist scrapes the teeth again.]

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:30.520
[Close-up of boy's mouth while the hygienist scrapes his teeth.]

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:41.540
[The hygienist polishes a front tooth.]

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:54.400
[She uses a mirror to view the boy's back teeth.]

00:03:55.540 --> 00:04:06.000
[Close-up of the boy's mouth as a dark solution is painted on his back teeth.]

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:29.810
[Close-up of the hygienist scraping the teeth with a dental tool.]

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:51.390
[Using a handheld model, the hygienist gives the boy a demonstration of the correct way to brush one's teeth.]

00:05:02.170 --> 00:06:00.100
[Close-up of the hygienist showing the correct way to brush teeth using herself as a model.]

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.870
[Diagram of teeth with a pointer indicating the starting points of decay.]

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.170
[Pointer shows areas where decay can start.]

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:49.480
[Points to surface of molars, then to areas between teeth where they touch.]

00:06:55.480 --> 00:07:01.500
[Diagram of one tooth.]

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:07.070
[Pointer again points to flat part of molar.]

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:13.760
[Animation shows cavity developing and spreading through the enamel.]

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:29.820
[Animation shows cavity spreading through dental pulp.]

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:44.120
[A male dentist is shown in an office with a young girl sitting in a dental chair.]

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:49.150
[The dentist wipes his hands and picks up a dental instrument.]

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:59.390
[The dentist is working in the patient's mouth with tools.]

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:06.810
[Close-up of the girl's mouth as the dentist examines her teeth.]

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:24.200
[Close-up of the dentist drilling out a cavity.]

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:29.540
[A solution is sprayed on the tooth.]

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:38.370
[A piece of gauze is used to clean out the cavity area.]

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:58.150
[The dentist fills the tooth with another substance.]

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:23.600
[A diagram of teeth in an early stage of decay is shown.]

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:27.870
[A pointer indicates the decayed areas.]

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:43.410
[A pointer shows the second and third stages of decay.]

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:55.770
[A pointer indicates a large cavity, the 4th stage of decay.]

00:09:56.460 --> 00:10:06.160
[Close-up of a mouth with a dental mirror showing a cavity.]

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:23.300
[An animated diagram shows a tooth as the cavity gets bigger and bigger.]

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:55.020
[Animation shows the spread of decay throughout the tooth, followed by formation of an abscess.]

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:21.140
[Two young girls are looking at a magazine.]

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:29.420
[One girl sucks on her finger.]

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:46.540
[Close-up of a mouth with a mirror showing how the upper teeth are protruding.]

00:11:54.020 --> 00:12:00.860
[Close-up of mouth with poorly developed teeth.]

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:09.880
[Close-up of mouth with spaces between front teeth on top and on bottom.]

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:24.190
[Close-up of crooked and misaligned teeth.]

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:34.560
[Close up of mouth with braces on the teeth.]

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:46.160
[Close-up of mouth with straight teeth.]

00:12:54.770 --> 00:13:21.150
[A girl is shown in a bathroom preparing to brush her teeth.]

00:13:21.540 --> 00:14:01.900
[The girl brushes her teeth and tongue.]

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:17.950
[The girl flosses her teeth.]

